{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_115_1000_022ser", "source_sha256": "82c8ebe5c023bd8f2c89b831f7e2a84ff170a7cf9acf9e33edfa034ba3ab9639", "ja": "アイスティーですか……\nそれが……。", "zh": "是冰红茶吗……\n那个……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_115_1001_001har", "source_sha256": "d414682e1c0342dafd6379d9298d80881c0a9499978b81326a888c095070d6f5", "ja": "星梨花ちゃん、どうかしたの？", "zh": "星梨花，你怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_115_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "1db143b56a9256bd41839b23d964b72b833e11d0eb15a6654e7ed4844bfb4cd8", "ja": "えっと……わたし、アイスティーが\nうまく淹れられないんです。", "zh": "那个……我不太会泡冰红茶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_115_1003_001har", "source_sha256": "d3e32afe377675a7e59b930a859dc884ae6232c7a6b04203c9a3f438058c7c3f", "ja": "もしかして、クリームダウンしちゃうってこと？\n紅茶が白く濁るっていう……。", "zh": "莫非是出现“冷后浑”了？\n就是红茶会变浑浊发白那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_115_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "7ad3e30784dcd02192445a6e1b5bdabef75969b64e0a1c7e207fb5a094285bfc", "ja": "は、はい！　そうなんです。\n何回やっても、クリームダウンしてしまって……。", "zh": "是、是的！就是这样。\n不管试多少次，都会出现奶茶浑浊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_115_1005_038chz", "source_sha256": "a4ef40adbb71c1fee07184ca319b4a5a7798b329ce7832922b6171d86fef528e", "ja": "アイスティーが濁るのは、お茶のタンニンと、\nカフェインが原因だと聞きましたわ。", "zh": "听说冰红茶变浑浊，是因为茶叶中的鞣酸和咖啡因。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_115_1006_038chz", "source_sha256": "12a517b3b54c9e0adaa34349fd20fe6b3d8832e12fd9cf39706a5fc6c975bfd2", "ja": "紅茶の温度を一気に下げてしまったほうが良いので、\n氷はたくさん使うとして……。", "zh": "最好一下子把红茶的温度降下来，所以冰块就多用一些……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_115_1007_038chz", "source_sha256": "82c9f1893ae9cbb47c44e0bb20253715a342f6fee53535bd62d43ad638912bfd", "ja": "あとは、タンニンが少ない茶葉を使うとか。甘みが\nあっても良ければ、砂糖を加えてしまうのも手ですわ。", "zh": "或者也可以用单宁含量较低的茶叶。要是不介意甜味，加点糖也是个办法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_115_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "c78d991c59aec49a0560f7d5e721ae612cbe58ee9b9302da45929408d1fb1188", "ja": "わぁ……そうなんですね！　千鶴さん、アイスティーの\n上手な淹れ方も知ってるなんて、すごいです！", "zh": "哇……原来是这样啊！千鹤小姐居然连\n好喝的冰红茶泡法都知道，好厉害！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_115_1009_038chz", "source_sha256": "2aec1f1870e8e964720820e29be72e40e660ecd7272eb2b16eddd69c6dbfc7cd", "ja": "い、いえ！　今のは、我が家のメイドから聞いた、\n豆知識で……たまたまですわ、たまたま！", "zh": "没、没有啦！刚才说的，只是从我家的女仆那里\n听来的小窍门……碰巧而已，碰巧罢了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_115_1010_001har", "source_sha256": "56481cb33960db67fb47591a3ebae75be449be5c5ac89074a2df13ce16513297", "ja": "メイドさんなら、紅茶を淹れるのも上手ですよね。\n星梨花ちゃんも練習したら、きっと上手にできるよ！", "zh": "女仆的话，泡红茶应该也很拿手吧。\n星梨花要是多练习，一定也能泡得很好哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_115_1011_022ser", "source_sha256": "b9f356a7b2a609fc963329c39bf6958586446f9e15a9da75a3e5a8382cb1f303", "ja": "はい！　お客様をしっかり\nおもてなしできるように、練習がんばります♪", "zh": "好的！为了能够好好招待客人，我会努力练习的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_115_1012_null", "source_sha256": "534926102baae34c319b1cac89e3647740919e97584a11a8715d60c59feeb7ba", "ja": "週末、箱崎家……", "zh": "周末，箱崎家……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_115_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "bf8cb8f5f3a3b192f508b8637392a412a76f95499c86499d13b62e92ea21d92a", "ja": "失礼します。\nお待たせしました、アイスティーです♪", "zh": "打扰了。\n让您久等了，这是冰红茶♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_115_1014_022ser", "source_sha256": "9aa940ccc8541aa38497ad75fd868609d492857476c2c40b5601e43d2ccafb36", "ja": "お好みで、シロップやミルクをお使いください。\n温かい紅茶もありますので、お申し付けくださいね！", "zh": "您可以根据喜好使用糖浆或牛奶。\n我们也准备了热红茶，有需要请告诉我哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_115_1015_serititiyuujinn1", "source_sha256": "80fad389c6eec292fd1174b6ac9c27a129c6c9a3ac8ecc0f6d231f45907a80d9", "ja": "おお、星梨花ちゃんじゃないか！\nひさしぶりだね。", "zh": "哦，这不是星梨花嘛！\n好久不见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_115_1016_serititiyuujinn2", "source_sha256": "ca530fa0e386847abd482fcdaf216adf0d1dc855303eb6610edec93eb20a7a3c", "ja": "しばらく見ないうちに、すっかり大きくなって……。\n元気だったかい？", "zh": "一段时间没见，已经长这么大了……  \n最近过得好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_115_1017_022ser", "source_sha256": "5fafecbd0ede34d9b13e4d75e88948c1b4ffe69ba7880c184a9ba270e292cba3", "ja": "こんにちは、おじさま！\nはい、とっても元気です。", "zh": "叔叔，您好！\n嗯，我精神好着呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_115_1018_serikanohaha", "source_sha256": "44ff3630c93bd980f721fff1ace77858f461e6aadefc58ae6678ecbbd789fd00", "ja": "今日のアイスティーは、星梨花が淹れたんですよ。\n劇場の先輩達に、上手な淹れ方を教えていただいて。", "zh": "今天的冰茶是我泡的哦。剧场的前辈们教了我怎么泡得更好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_115_1019_serikanohaha", "source_sha256": "19b0d569d23e793679065b508b5f8d7bc3f5181e77457f697ef48aedf058ee2f", "ja": "それに、お菓子を作るのも手伝ってくれて……。", "zh": "而且还帮我做了点心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_115_1020_022ser", "source_sha256": "cee64c00f0d124700987d64a30ed74e61007093180042c4b267bdf86865d07d1", "ja": "夏のお茶会なら冷たいお菓子がいいって、\nいろいろ教えてもらったんです。どうぞ！", "zh": "她们说夏天的茶会吃冰凉的点心比较好，\n教了我好多呢。请用吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_115_1021_serititiyuujinn3", "source_sha256": "a2bcdef18b40a8c45be1f99243d108d7bcf6bb20330caff682b3b4a9840faaad", "ja": "それは是非、いただかないとだね。", "zh": "那一定得收下才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_115_1022_serititiyuujinn4", "source_sha256": "d2e23395382c3142f9256ea1602afe9a65c266c02cb563d4d304282449318dc0", "ja": "この前、星梨花ちゃんがテレビに出ているのを見たよ。\nアイドル活動、順調みたいだね。", "zh": "前几天，我看到星梨花上电视了。\n偶像活动好像进行得很顺利呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_115_1023_022ser", "source_sha256": "05b9f632a1b7a06338100f2e20e3610337ef5f459e084d1c6c5be2194c986dfe", "ja": "はい！　おじさまがアイドルのことを教えて\nくださったおかげで、わたし、とっても楽しいです！", "zh": "是的！多亏叔叔教了我偶像的事情，我现在特别开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_115_1024_serititiyuujinn4", "source_sha256": "f09b3596e134e7136bd5ecc839ab633fa78da18843e773dd68b018049b2696d0", "ja": "それなら良かった。お父さんが随分と\n反対していると聞いて、心配してたんだ。", "zh": "那就好。我听说你爸爸非常反对，一直很担心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_115_1025_serikanotiti", "source_sha256": "0590afddc1f158a62427393cc1a0dcea03f144e1f60a5bc0f1ea01c21170680c", "ja": "いや、それは……。", "zh": "不，那是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_115_1026_serititiyuujinn4", "source_sha256": "6591928adb3f9f05c7ebcef3ba41f830e11ebd819c7cc37858991fe96ee3d3b6", "ja": "でも、星梨花ちゃんは以前より、しっかりして見える。\n私の目は確かだったみたいだ。", "zh": "不过，星梨花看起来比以前稳重多了。\n看来我的眼光没错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_115_1027_022ser", "source_sha256": "d4311d5d693cc6d9f3587ac6149c1114a6a1e8bf187e9b441c54386b472b0e11", "ja": "本当ですか！？　ありがとうございます！", "zh": "真的吗！？非常感谢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_115_1028_serikanotiti", "source_sha256": "23cc7b209c835d68eefb2c3ff0439730d6d2c467adfcb064ef5d5f0034174bf6", "ja": "その、私も無闇に反対していたというわけでは……\n星梨花が努力している姿は、勿論、目にしていますし。", "zh": "那个，我也不是毫无缘由地反对……  \n星梨花努力的身影，我当然也看在眼里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_115_1029_serikanotiti", "source_sha256": "57b037a1c1f98de7600590acb8febab8fbc7d66d2982d03839d106f66e025586", "ja": "そうだ、星梨花。良かったら皆さんに、\nあれをお見せしてあげたらどうだ？　この前の……。", "zh": "对了，星梨花。方便的话，要不要把那个给大家看看？就是前几天的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_115_1030_022ser", "source_sha256": "9830328c9b0b6e8827c87d0ee526aeb8268e41a95ac437040aef741dc41747a2", "ja": "あれ？", "zh": "那个？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_115_1031_serikanohaha", "source_sha256": "c0d8f572a019419578e67d3b0f5f8def29fa5099d7e763467bce8ba4e950d8e8", "ja": "あれじゃないかしら？\n北東エリアのツアーで歌った、難しい曲……。", "zh": "是不是那个？\n在东北地区巡演时唱过的那首难曲……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_115_1032_022ser", "source_sha256": "9811a9b8e6a6489fd2eade7581c1143df6ae1db7ba7a65bffb807cfe8fbe50c3", "ja": "あっ、『産声とクラブ』のことかな？\nはい、パパ！", "zh": "啊，是不是指《初啼与俱乐部》？\n好的，爸爸！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_115_1033_022ser", "source_sha256": "7b85e2bffc35c109586e1ef3fc28fdf2e6ac23ae0255b6012625a426f6873c1e", "ja": "ええと……この曲です！", "zh": "嗯……就是这首歌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_115_1034_serititiyuujinn3", "source_sha256": "e16d3acfabc59b7dda08d9aabf7a1df534eaf4232f923ed30781506d628d0d2c", "ja": "おお！　これは、コンテンポラリーダンスですな。\nアイドルがコンテンポラリーダンスとは……。", "zh": "哦哦！这是现代舞啊。\n偶像跳现代舞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_115_1035_serititiyuujinn2", "source_sha256": "31852999b1a141d4e313375eeeeeecdfbf1b6fc1f53ac34a9e6505e912ac7deb", "ja": "なるほど、ツアー先によってテーマを変えているのか。\n実に面白い試みだね。", "zh": "原来如此，是根据巡演地点来改变主题的吗？\n真是个非常有趣的尝试呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_115_1036_serititiyuujinn4", "source_sha256": "1ab643efbf6e87e3ff1c1e2ad7ca41fcaf6bd7b9a743717dcdee48ce306eec34", "ja": "星梨花ちゃん、他にも色々やっているんだろう？\nいい機会だし、皆さんに教えてあげたらどうかな。", "zh": "星梨花，你还做了其他各种事情吧？正好借这个机会，告诉大家怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_115_1037_022ser", "source_sha256": "a73582f5159655722f41a937ee39ce4835cf011a37b17633a9b28cfb19e728d2", "ja": "はい！　他にも、LOVERS HEART公演では、\n中央エリアの駅前で……。", "zh": "是！另外，在LOVERS HEART公演中，还在中央区域的车站前……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
